  "acceptance_invariants": [
    "POST requires the proposal_token attached to the reviewed child proposal; node-only approval is rejected.",
    "Current child turn, status, cancellation and proposal are re-read inside the same write transaction as permission, dispatch and workflow.granted receipt.",
    "A changed or corrupt proposal cannot be authorized by an older review.",
    "Exact committed replays preserve the original permission, including later revocation or expiry, and cannot replace a cancellation dispatch.",
    "Concurrent identical submissions create one authorization and one grant dispatch registration.",
    "Read-only UI recovery does not replay approval and stale callbacks cannot replace a different scope or a newer cancellation."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The change covers workflow approvals; the independent single-task approval path is outside this increment.",
    "Clients must read proposal_token before presenting and approving a proposal; older node-only clients need updating.",
    "UI recovery state is page-local; authoritative approvals and receipts persist on the server.",
    "HTTP replay may attempt to advance an already saved dispatch, but does not create a new dispatch or permission.",
    "Business tools remain simulated; no external model calls, package rebuild or deployment occurred."
  ],
